        'Carbon-dioxide release can offset oxygen uptake; use a suitable absorbent separated from the tissue.~Temperature changes can alter gas volume without respiration; equilibrate and use a matched physical control.~One sample per treatment does not estimate biological variation; use independent replicates with matched seed mass and condition.',
